      "issue": "sync仅取得目录时验证expiresAt；随后credentials/Key/cache等待跨越目录截止但proof仍有效，提交guard只核proof/原许可/观察TTL，最终可错误返回configuration ready。",
      "sequence": [
        "合法签名directory.expiresAt早于同次proof.expiresAt",
        "credentials或putManagedCredential/cache.save等待跨directory截止",
        "assertCurrent与observation.check仍成功",
        "过期目录保存并返回UPGRADE_READY"
      ],
      "minimalFix": "原三个commit边界复核该directory截止；保原权益ready的partial语义；新增真实签名短目录RED并验0后续写/不ready。",
